== Effect ==
* Spawns a conjoined [[familiar]], much like {{E|Gemini}}'s small twin, Suture. It chases enemies close to Isaac, dealing 3 damage per tick (~6.43 damage per second).

== Notes ==
* {{dlc+|r+}} This item has a 1% chance to drop when defeating {{e|Gemini}}.{{dlc-}}
* Despite its appearance and description, Gemini does not count towards the {{tf|Conjoined}} transformation.

== Interaction ==
* {{t|Duct Tape}}: The familiar will stay in place relative to Isaac, but the effect of chasing enemies persists.
* {{I|King Baby}}: Suture will rest near King Baby if there are no enemies near Isaac, but will snap towards the enemy once one gets close enough to Isaac. Otherwise, no functional difference.
* {{T|RC Remote}}: The familiar can be extended way past its attack range, and will still do contact damage, but will only chase when an enemy enters the usual aggro distance.

