== Trivia ==
* {{dlc|a+}} The Gemini familiar is now animated, turning red and chasing enemies, similar to how Suture chases the player after Contusion is killed, based on [https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1239674288 this Steam Workshop mod] by piber20.
* Gemini's item ID is 318, putting it outside the range of other Zodiac items that are 299 to 309.

